<title>SINGAPORE: Zagro Asia 96 net profit up 10.4 percent.</title>
<headline>Zagro Asia 96 net profit up 10.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				5.52 vs  5.00</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)		   20.00 vs  nil</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		     5.39 vs  5.56</p>
<p>    Turnover				 65.94 vs 54.93</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 2.61 vs  1.18</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    0.24 vs  0.38</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortisation	   0.45 vs  0.40</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	     0.17 vs  0.30</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  7.45 vs  6.62</p>
<p>    Tax					 2.09 vs  1.92</p>
<p>Note - Zagro Asia Ltd makes agri-healthcare products.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
